  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-clean-desktop-shell-pro",
      "text": "[English](README.en.md) | 中文\n\n`dsh-clean-desktop-shell` 的增强版（fork）：在原有「把 web profile 包装成原生桌面窗口」的基础上，补齐了桌面应用应有的后端生命周期管理。"
    },
    {
      "section": "相比原版的增强",
      "text": "1. **启动自动启动后端** — 双击窗口后无需再手动点「启动后端」，本地 `dsh web` 后端会自动拉起。\n2. **不打开浏览器** — 后端以 `--no-open` 启动，只弹出原生窗口，不再弹出浏览器网页。\n3. **退出时询问是否关闭后端** — 托盘「退出」会弹出「关闭后端并退出 / 仅退出 / 取消」三选项。\n4. **后端与窗口并行启动** — 后端在 Electron 初始化阶段就提前启动，冷启动更快。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-clean-desktop-shell-pro\n```\n\n安装后重启 `dsh web`。它会复用现有的 web profile 与 Electron 运行时（`$DSH_HOME/desktop-shell-runtime`）。\n\n> 若已安装原版 `dsh-clean-desktop-shell`，请先卸载以避免两个桌面外壳同时启动：\n>\n> ```sh\n> dsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-clean-desktop-shell\n> ```"
    },
    {
      "section": "桌面快捷方式",
      "text": "首次启动后，可从托盘右键菜单「创建桌面快捷方式」生成桌面图标；或使用窗口首次运行时弹出的提示创建。"
    },
    {
      "section": "许可与来源",
      "text": "本包是 [dsh-clean-desktop-shell](https://github.com/Icather/dsh-clean-desktop-shell)（MIT）的 fork，保留其 LICENSE 与贡献者名单。"
    },
    {
      "section": "发布前待办（仅作者）",
      "text": "发布前请在 `electron/update.js` 中把 `YOUR_NAME` 替换为你的 GitHub 用户名，并建好对应仓库。"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-clean-desktop-shell-pro",
      "text": "English | [中文](README.md)\n\nAn enhanced fork of `dsh-clean-desktop-shell`: on top of \"wrap your web profile in a native window\", it fills in the backend lifecycle management a desktop app should have."
    },
    {
      "section": "Enhancements over upstream",
      "text": "1. **Auto-start the backend on launch** — no more clicking \"start backend\" manually; the local `dsh web` backend is started automatically.\n2. **No browser window** — the backend is started with `--no-open`, so only the native window appears, never a browser tab.\n3. **Ask before closing the backend on quit** — the tray \"quit\" shows \"close backend and quit / quit only / cancel\".\n4. **Backend starts in parallel with Electron** — the backend is kicked off during Electron init, so cold start is faster."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-clean-desktop-shell-pro\n```\n\nThen restart `dsh web`. It reuses your existing web profile and the Electron runtime (`$DSH_HOME/desktop-shell-runtime`).\n\n> If you already have the upstream `dsh-clean-desktop-shell` installed, remove it first to avoid two desktop shells starting at once:\n>\n> ```sh\n> dsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-clean-desktop-shell\n> ```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Desktop shortcut",
      "text": "After the first launch, use the tray right-click menu → \"create desktop shortcut\", or the first-run prompt."
    },
    {
      "section": "License & attribution",
      "text": "This package is a fork of [dsh-clean-desktop-shell](https://github.com/Icather/dsh-clean-desktop-shell) (MIT), keeping its LICENSE and contributor list."
    },
    {
      "section": "Pre-publish TODO (authors only)",
      "text": "Before publishing, replace `YOUR_NAME` in `electron/update.js` with your GitHub username and create the corresponding repository."
    }
